<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Verificación 2FA — Atención Domiciliaria</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a2332 0%, #2d3748 100%); min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
        .card { width: 100%; max-width: 420px; border: none; border-radius: 1rem; box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
        .card-header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3182ce, #2b6cb0); border-radius: 1rem 1rem 0 0; padding: 2rem; text-align: center; color: white; }
        input[type="text"] { letter-spacing: .4em; font-size: 1.5rem; text-align: center; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
    <div class="card-header">
        <i class="bi bi-shield-lock-fill" style="font-size:2.5rem"></i>
        <h4 class="mt-2 mb-0 fw-bold">Verificación en dos pasos</h4>
        <small class="opacity-75">Abre tu app autenticadora</small>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body p-4">
        {% for msg in app.flashes('error') %}
            <div class="alert alert-danger d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                <i class="bi bi-x-circle-fill"></i><div>{{ msg }}</div>
            </div>
        {% endfor %}

        <p class="text-muted text-center mb-4">
            Ingresa el código de 6 dígitos de <strong>Google Authenticator</strong> o <strong>Authy</strong>.
        </p>

        <form method="post" action="{{ path('2fa_login_check') }}" autocomplete="off">
            <div class="mb-4">
                <input type="text" name="{{ two_factor_code_parameter }}"
                       class="form-control form-control-lg text-center"
                       maxlength="8" autofocus placeholder="000000"
                       inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9A-Z]{6,8}">
                <div class="form-text text-center mt-2">
                    También puedes ingresar un <a href="#" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#backupHelp">código de respaldo</a>.
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="collapse mb-3" id="backupHelp">
                <div class="alert alert-info small">
                    Los códigos de respaldo son de 8 caracteres alfanuméricos (ej: A1B2C3D4). Cada código solo puede usarse una vez.
                </div>
            </div>
            <input type="hidden" name="_csrf_token" value="{{ csrf_token('2fa') }}">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary w-100 py-2 fw-semibold">
                <i class="bi bi-check-circle me-2"></i>Verificar
            </button>
        </form>

        <div class="text-center mt-3">
            <a href="{{ path('app_logout') }}" class="small text-muted">
                <i class="bi bi-arrow-left me-1"></i>Volver al login
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
